{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, טְעֵם²","hw":"טְעֵם²","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">טְעֵם</span></big><sub>30</sub>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">Ezr 4:21</a> <strong>taste, judgment, command (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">טַ֫עַם</span> (late sense)<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:10\" href=\"/Daniel.3.10\">Dn 3:10</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">ט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">5:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">Ezr 6:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">טַ֫עַם</span> (of God, mere scribal distinction Nö <sup>LCB 1896, 305</sup> Str<sup>§ 8 c</sup> K<sup>Aramaismen 40</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">Ezr 6:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:23\" href=\"/Ezra.7.23\">7:23</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַעְמָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">4:21</a> +;—<br>†<strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">Dn 5:2</a> in <em>the taste</em> of the wine (while they were enjoying it).<br>†<strong>2.</strong>  <em>judgment, discretion</em>, in reply, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲתִיב עֵטָא וּט׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:14\" href=\"/Daniel.2.14\">Dn 2:14</a> (<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.16\">Pr 26:16</a>); in act (pers.) <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂים ט׳ על</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:12\" href=\"/Daniel.3.12\">Dn 3:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:14\" href=\"/Daniel.6.14\">6:14</a> <em>shew proper deference</em> to <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל)</span>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  <em>report</em> (of official), c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הלך</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:5\" href=\"/Ezra.5.5\">Ezr 5:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יהב</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:3\" href=\"/Daniel.6.3\">Dn 6:3</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>command</em>, of God <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">Ezr 6:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:23\" href=\"/Ezra.7.23\">7:23</a>, of king <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:14\" href=\"/Ezra.6.14\">6:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂים ט׳</span> <em>give command, issue decree</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:10\" href=\"/Daniel.3.10\">Dn 3:10</a> + 3 times, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:19\" href=\"/Ezra.4.19\">Ezr 4:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:21\" href=\"/Ezra.4.21\">21</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 11 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעֵל ט׳</span> <em>commander</em> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:8\" href=\"/Ezra.4.8\">Ezr 4:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:9\" href=\"/Ezra.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:17\" href=\"/Ezra.4.17\">17</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, טְפַר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, טְעֵם"}